WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.688
Your coffee is bitter for one reason and
it is not the beans.

00:00:03.688 --> 00:00:06.469
You are grinding too fine and over
extracting.

00:00:06.469 --> 00:00:11.185
Everybody blames the beans first because
the beans are the thing you paid for.

00:00:11.185 --> 00:00:14.812
The grinder is the thing you ignored. Go
two clicks coarser.

00:00:14.812 --> 00:00:19.770
Taste it. If it goes sour you went too
far, come back one. Thirty seconds of
work.
